# SAP SD Integration Blueprint

## Project Overview
This project presents a conceptual blueprint for integrating SAP Sales and Distribution (SD) with inventory management, warehouse operations, billing, and Financial Accounting.

## Project Objectives
- Understand the SAP SD Order-to-Cash (O2C) process.
- Identify business requirements and stakeholders.
- Map sales, delivery, billing, and accounting processes.
- Identify integration challenges and recommend solutions.
- Develop an implementation roadmap.

## SAP Modules Covered
- **SAP SD:** Sales orders, pricing, delivery, and billing
- **SAP MM:** Materials and inventory management
- **SAP FI/CO:** Financial accounting and profitability
- **Warehouse Operations:** Picking, packing, and goods issue

## Deliverables
- SAP SD Integration Blueprint (PDF)
- Order-to-Cash process mapping
- Proposed system integration architecture
- Strategic recommendations and implementation roadmap

## Project Status
Conceptual learning project prepared as part of a Week 1 internship assignment. It does not represent a live SAP system implementation.

## Skills Demonstrated
- SAP SD business process understanding
- Requirement analysis
- Process mapping
- Integration planning
- Business documentation
